    cml:logicSummary "Temporal overlap between quashed conviction and prison confinement periods" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is confined to a prison does not include a period during which the person has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a sentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed." ;
    cml:conclusionText "The quashed conviction and the prison confinement periods overlap" ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::interval_reasoning" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

