    cml:logicSummary "Child's citizenship begins at age 16 if parents apply under section 21 and the Minister approves." ;
    cml:premiseText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to a child aged under 16..." ;
    cml:conclusionText "if: 1 or more responsible parents of the child made applications under section 21 at that time; and the Minister decided under section 24 to approve the child and 1 or more of the responsible parents becoming Australian citizens." ;
